      "en": "For through the LORD’s voice the Assyrian will be dismayed. He will strike him with his rod.",
      "ko": "여호와의 목소리에 앗수르가 낙담할 것이며 주께서는 막대기로 치실 것인데",
      "source_text_hash": "f0a7e06d3889546599daeb28362d36efa0a58107d25532ef37efb5ca1decfee4",
      "translation_text_hash": "0d593f38e9f7794941408b93140410b938d79ca460b4ff67419c8ea8e7816a24",
