        "verse": 33
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "ISA",
          "chapter": 30,
          "verse": 33
        }
      ],
      "en": "For his burning place has long been ready. Yes, it is prepared for the king. He has made its pyre deep and large with fire and much wood. The LORD’s breath, like a stream of sulfur, kindles it.",
      "ko": "대저 도벳은 이미 설립되었고 또 왕을 위하여 예비된 것이라 깊고 넓게 하였고 거기 불과 많은 나무가 있은즉 여호와의 호흡이 유황 개천 같아서 이를 사르시리라",
      "source_text_hash": "90ec19886fbb415c162a337cd19b1feeb3fffb897342e63a716050555ce77b84",
      "translation_text_hash": "a95e5cb41d48bcb26129178afe48e018610b00718130efb63576beaad2494251",
